	(text "ESP32-S3 GPIO 3.3 V in, 5 V out through SN74AHCT125N. 220R in series with every data line.\nOutputs J1-J4 are 3-way screw terminals: pin 1 +5V (pigtail red), pin 2 data (green), pin 3 GND (white). J5 USB in and J1-J4 are Phoenix MPT 0,5 2.54 mm blocks.\nToday only OUT1 (GPIO 4) and OUT2 (GPIO 5) are built; OUT3 (GPIO 6) and OUT4 (GPIO 7) are wired the same way later."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 40.64 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "5862544f-6958-4cb4-b2cb-eb1661070ec6")
	)
	(text "Power: USB-A cable from the bank, red to +5V, black to GND. C1 1000 uF, long leg to +5V.\nThe ESP32-S3 is powered from this rail through its 5V and GND header pins."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 180.34 134.62 0)
